# Seeds for arith.c: three little-endian i32 words (x, y, z).
# Deliberately narrow - small positives with y <= z - so Daikon starts out
# overconfident and the loop has something to refute.
i32: 5 3 9
i32: 12 7 40
i32: 1 1 1
i32: 30 2 31
i32: 8 15 20
i32: 44 9 50
i32: 3 25 26
i32: 17 4 99
i32: 21 21 60
i32: 9 30 31
i32: 2 6 7
i32: 60 11 70
